{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to\u00a0</strong>Sunshine Story<strong>!</strong><br>Here, the line between survival and serenity is reimagined. Sip a warm drink, don your straw hat, and embark on a pastoral adventure through your own cozy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft Your Utopia, Brick by Brick</strong><br>Build whimsical storybook hideaways with 200+ modular pixel blocks! From treetop cottages to coastal lighthouses, design your dream sanctuary. Curl up in your handcrafted attic at dusk, listening to wind chimes dance beneath starlit skies \u2013 this is your haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guild Gatherings: Chill Co-op Play</strong><br>Form an\u00a0<strong>Idle Alliance</strong>\u00a0with friends! Fish, farm, and build together while tackling mystic dungeon bosses. Unwind afterward at bonfire cookouts, grilling rainbow trout under the moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Slow-Paced Homesteader\u2019s Life</strong><br>Shear fluffy sheep at dawn, tend magic-infused garlic gardens by noon, and craft Galaxy Pudding with fresh milk at sunset. Master seasonal planting cycles to stock your ever-growing pantry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival, Elegantly Redefined</strong><br>Thirsty? Sip garden-fresh veggie smoothies! Hungry? Fire up stone-oven pizzas or sizzling steaks to restore your joy meter. No apocalypse here \u2013 just poetic challenges woven into nature\u2019s rhythm.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347810?t=1746952336","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347810?t=1746952336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s